 "Great basilicas": "伟大的大殿",
 "The four papal basilicas of Rome and other great churches of the world": "罗马的四座宗座大殿和世界其他伟大的教堂",
 "Saint Peter's Basilica": "圣伯多禄大殿",
 "Vatican City": "梵蒂冈城",
