 "Manila Cathedral": "马尼拉主教座堂",
 "Manila, Philippines": "菲律宾，马尼拉",
 "In Intramuros, the walled city. Rebuilt eight times after fires, earthquakes and war, it is the mother church of the Philippines.": "位于城墙环绕的王城区。历经火灾、地震和战争八次重建，是菲律宾的母堂。"
